  id: wash
  title: '7. Customer States: Slight Flood'
  region: Tin Cup Wash
  briefing: A flash flood is entering the wash. Follow four marked high-ground checkpoints
    and extract before the channel fills. Corporate patrols are still attempting
    a traffic stop.
  opening: 'Ellis: Rain upstream. We leave now. No joke. Follow the markers and do
    not stop in the channel.'
  midpoint: 'Mara: They installed a toll reader in a dry wash. It just invoiced a
    boulder for an oversized vehicle.'
  closing: 'Ellis: Everyone is clear. The automated toll notice has been forwarded
    to the river.'
  optionalObjective: Keep at least 55% chassis health
